{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN#0001", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN", "offset": 909, "capacity": 60, "raw_hex": "f5c2f16bf8e7f25ef374f0b2f1b2f1c781432f2ff3f0f1d8f9aef369f36df8b2f473f0eff0a5f29ef0a9f7d12f2ff0acf0b88143f273f274f0af8148", "baseline_text": "쌍무를 움직이려면，//엄청난 영력이 필요하겠군…//레니，괜찮아？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "双武を動かすには、//すさまじい霊力が必要だな……//レニ、大丈夫か？", "pointer_offset": 764, "unit": "dialogue:dc23e0b659024263", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN#0002", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN", "offset": 2373, "capacity": 42, "raw_hex": "f0b1f157f7d1f273f274f0af81442f2ff0e2f0e4f0b2f148f263f0a38143f273f274f8f3f1c8f1488148", "baseline_text": "나는…괜찮아．//대장이야말로，괜찮은 거야？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ボクは……大丈夫。//隊長こそ、平気かい？", "pointer_offset": 768, "unit": "dialogue:9ac81209f2f12b2d", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN#0003", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN", "offset": 1017, "capacity": 18, "raw_hex": "f0aff0af8143f0b1f8f4f273f274f0af8144", "baseline_text": "아아，나도 괜찮아．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ああ、俺も大丈夫だ。", "pointer_offset": 772, "unit": "dialogue:d432c902c9c1b0f8", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN#0004", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN", "offset": 1038, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f0d8f27ef168f0b1f7d1f0cff1a7f0b2f14881442f2ff0e2f0e4f8b2f273f274f0cff1c781432f2ff0b1f157f7d1f273f274f0af8144", "baseline_text": "그렇구나…다행이야．//대장이 괜찮다면，//나는…괜찮아．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "そう……よかった。//隊長が平気なら、//ボクは……大丈夫だ。", "pointer_offset": 776, "unit": "dialogue:b26723d1ab0257d4", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN#0005", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN", "offset": 1097, "capacity": 62, "raw_hex": "f0b2f142f957f271f272f29ef0a4f1d481432f2ff0e2f0e4f8c8f279f14bf147f0a8f1c7f7d12f2ff25cf2c0f8a4fa57f94af154f8c8fa99f16ff0af8144", "baseline_text": "이유는 모르겠지만，//대장을 위해서라면…//뭐든지 할 수 있을 것 같아．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "理由はわからないけど、//隊長のためになら……//なんでもできるって思える。", "pointer_offset": 780, "unit": "dialogue:5ea1dd6a6ad66bf1", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN#0006", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN", "offset": 1170, "capacity": 56, "raw_hex": "f0e2f0e4f8c8f0c6f0f7f0a5f1c7f7d12f2ff15afb6ff1ccf0b2f0a8f0f481432f2ff372fb4df0b1faecf94af154f8c8fa99f16ff0af8144", "baseline_text": "대장을 생각하면…//어떤 일이라도，//헤쳐 나갈 수 있을 것 같아．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "隊長のことを考えると……//どんなことでも、//乗り越えられると思えるんだ。", "pointer_offset": 784, "unit": "dialogue:c903b1674783999e", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN#0007", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN", "offset": 1243, "capacity": 6, "raw_hex": "f0acf0b8f7d1", "baseline_text": "레니…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "レニ……", "pointer_offset": 788, "unit": "dialogue:4bc071b648458872", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN#0008", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN", "offset": 1252, "capacity": 22, "raw_hex": "f0d8f0f1f7d1f0a6f282f1a9f0cff957f1c8f1488144", "baseline_text": "그게…사랑한다는 거야．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "それが……愛するってことだよ。", "pointer_offset": 792, "unit": "dialogue:9d8195f54513ac3a", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN#0009", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN", "offset": 1283, "capacity": 24, "raw_hex": "f0b1f8f4f0acf0b8f9d7f16ff8f3f0adf2c3f0b2f1488144", "baseline_text": "나도 레니와 같은 마음이야．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "俺もレニと同じ気持ちだよ。", "pointer_offset": 796, "unit": "dialogue:1250fc99c46eb11b", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN#0010", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN", "offset": 1310, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f0d8f0f1f7d1f0a6f282f1a9f0cff957f1c8f14881442f2ff0acf0b8f7d1f1f7f9eaf0b2f26afa57f0f12f2ff1b5f15a8144", "baseline_text": "그게…사랑한다는 거야．//레니…전혀 이상할 게//없어．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "それが……愛するってことだよ。//レニ……不思議でも、//なんでもないさ。", "pointer_offset": 800, "unit": "dialogue:22c63271131d9df2", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN#0011", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN", "offset": 1381, "capacity": 6, "raw_hex": "f0e2f0e4f7d1", "baseline_text": "대장…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "隊長……", "pointer_offset": 804, "unit": "dialogue:62f89a7ac3998ed5", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN#0012", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN", "offset": 1390, "capacity": 44, "raw_hex": "f0e2f0e4f8c8f279f14bf147f0a8f1c781432f2ff16bf2c5f0b2fac0fa57f94af154f8c8fa99f16ff0aff7d1", "baseline_text": "대장을 위해서라면，//무엇이든 할 수 있을 것 같아…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "隊長のためになら、//なんだってできると思う……", "pointer_offset": 808, "unit": "dialogue:87e99334edd56d22", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN#0013", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN", "offset": 1437, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f0d8f0f1f7d12f2ff0a6f282f0d3f8a4f0aff3a0f0a4f15781432f2ff0b1f957fa80f271f272f29ef0a4f1d4f7d1", "baseline_text": "그게…//사랑인지 아닌지는，//나는 잘 모르겠지만…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "それが……//愛なのかどうか、//ボクにはわからないけど……", "pointer_offset": 812, "unit": "dialogue:1fbd6df421d9cce4", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN#0014", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN", "offset": 1494, "capacity": 34, "raw_hex": "f8b2f0adf2c3f1d4f286f0f3f7d12f2ff1c8f190f263f8b2f0aff0b8f0b8f2618144", "baseline_text": "이 마음만큼은…//거짓말이 아니니까．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "この気持ちだけは……//ウソじゃないから。", "pointer_offset": 816, "unit": "dialogue:f3f14d223703cd83", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN#0015", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN", "offset": 1535, "capacity": 6, "raw_hex": "f0acf0b8f7d1", "baseline_text": "레니…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "レニ……", "pointer_offset": 820, "unit": "dialogue:4bc071b648458872", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN#0016", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN", "offset": 1544, "capacity": 52, "raw_hex": "f0e2f0e4f7d1f1bdfa5ef16ff8f3f28af7d12f2ff290f8aef3a1f99cf26cf0aef0fa81442f2ff0d8f0aef1848143f0b1f1d7f7d1", "baseline_text": "대장…싸움 같은 건…//빨리 끝내 버리자．//그리고，나와…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "隊長……戦いなんか……//早く終わらせよう。//そして、ボクと……", "pointer_offset": 824, "unit": "dialogue:f9b816c4883062e9", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN#0017", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN", "offset": 1607, "capacity": 30, "raw_hex": "f0aff0af8143f0d8f27ef0f081442f2ff2c9f2e9f15a8143f0acf0b88144", "baseline_text": "아아，그렇네．//알았어，레니．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ああ、そうだな。//わかったよ、レニ。", "pointer_offset": 828, "unit": "dialogue:510e9a0081f8f856", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN#0018", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN", "offset": 1644, "capacity": 62, "raw_hex": "f0b1f8f4f0acf0b8f9d7f16ff8f3f0adf2c3f0b2f14881442f2ff0acf0b8f9d7f2c8f160f0a8f1c781432f2ff16bf2c5f0b2fac0fa57f94af154f15a8144", "baseline_text": "나도 레니와 같은 마음이야．//레니와 함께라면，//무엇이든 할 수 있어．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "俺もレニと同じ気持ちだよ。//レニと一緒なら、//なんだってできるさ。", "pointer_offset": 832, "unit": "dialogue:53105fd0b45617e1", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN#0019", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN", "offset": 1711, "capacity": 42, "raw_hex": "f7d1f25cf493f26181442f2ff0e2f0e4f8e1f263f9d4f1daf15af0f481432f2ff191f36cf8b2f267f7d1", "baseline_text": "…뭐랄까．//대장의 말만 들어도，//안심이 돼…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "……なんなんだろうね。//隊長の言葉を聞くだけで、//安心できる……", "pointer_offset": 836, "unit": "dialogue:2f858f1ea58c4e3a", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN#0020", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN", "offset": 1776, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f0e2f8e4f3b2f8b9f154f957f299f1d4f0a2f0a3f0f4f7d12f2ff0adf2c3f8b2f3a5f14bf1d0f7d1", "baseline_text": "대장 곁에 있는 것만으로도…//마음이 편해져…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "隊長のそばにいるだけで……//心が落ち着く……", "pointer_offset": 840, "unit": "dialogue:2488f61097c36616", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN#0021", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN", "offset": 1821, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "f2acf0bc8143f0b2f299f0b2f7d12f2ff0a6f17df8c8f0a6f282f1a9f0cff957f2e1f261f7d1", "baseline_text": "혹시，이것이…//사람을 사랑한다는 걸까…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "もしかして、これが……//人を愛するってことなのかな……", "pointer_offset": 844, "unit": "dialogue:ab1311d62c9e3cc5", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN#0022", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN", "offset": 2416, "capacity": 26, "raw_hex": "f24cf24df0b6f7d1f0d8f26ff0a4f8f4f271f272f29ef0f08144", "baseline_text": "확실히…그럴지도 모르겠네．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "確かに……そうかもね。", "pointer_offset": 848, "unit": "dialogue:37ac3ae98199cf18", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN#0023", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN", "offset": 1899, "capacity": 30, "raw_hex": "f0e2f0e4f0f4f7d12f2ff0b1f9d7f16ff8f3f0adf2c3f8d3f1c8f0a48148", "baseline_text": "대장도…//나와 같은 마음인 거지？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "隊長も……//ボクと同じ気持ちなんだよね。", "pointer_offset": 852, "unit": "dialogue:c9d7a437210ebf27", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN#0024", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN", "offset": 1940, "capacity": 32, "raw_hex": "f0aff0af8143f1e1f0af81442f2ff0b1f0f4f7d1f0acf0b8f9d7f16ff0af8144", "baseline_text": "아아，맞아．//나도…레니와 같아．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ああ、そうだよ。//俺も……レニと同じさ。", "pointer_offset": 856, "unit": "dialogue:1aea0c727586dec2", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN#0025", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN", "offset": 1981, "capacity": 14, "raw_hex": "f0e2f0e4f7d1f184f0adf1c98144", "baseline_text": "대장…고마워．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "隊長……ありがとう。", "pointer_offset": 860, "unit": "dialogue:3cbc2c08ce3c9fa9", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN#0026", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN", "offset": 2002, "capacity": 8, "raw_hex": "8163816381638163", "baseline_text": "…………", "kind": "ascr", "source": "…………", "pointer_offset": 864, "unit": "dialogue:b5999fb8c439aedc", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN#0027", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN", "offset": 2011, "capacity": 22, "raw_hex": "f0e2f0e4f7d12f2ff156f191f9a9fa8af2c9f0af8144", "baseline_text": "대장…//불안한 건 알아．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "隊長……//不安なのはわかる。", "pointer_offset": 868, "unit": "dialogue:d9c280bbd2ea0b1f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN#0028", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN", "offset": 2040, "capacity": 64, "raw_hex": "f0ecf0c3f8e1f1f7fb6df2bdf8e7f0c6f0f7f0a5f1c781432f2ff8b2f5c2f16bf1d4f0a2f0a3f15781432f2ff0b2faa2f94af154f8c8f0aef944f1b5f15af7d1", "baseline_text": "적과의 전력 차를 생각하면，//이 쌍무만으로는，//이길 수 있을 리가 없어…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "敵との戦力差を考えても、//この双武だけで、//勝てるわけがない……", "pointer_offset": 872, "unit": "dialogue:96fd85e35354b7de", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN#0029", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN", "offset": 2105, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f0a5f0a4f1d48143f273f274f0aff7d12f2ff1adf0aef0b9f0f1f15781432f2ff271f0f9f944f154f0a2f0b8f2618144", "baseline_text": "하지만，괜찮아…//우리에게는，//모두가 있으니까．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "でも、大丈夫だよ……//ボクたちには、//みんながいる。", "pointer_offset": 876, "unit": "dialogue:c23cfe871468ae01", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN#0030", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN", "offset": 2443, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f8b2f0b5f0b5f144f8abf163f164f165f0b2f0a8f1c7f7d12f2ff1cefaaaf0b2faa2f94af154f8c8f1c8f1488144", "baseline_text": "이 오오가미 화격단이라면…//분명 이길 수 있을 거야．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "この大神華撃団なら……//きっと勝てるよ。", "pointer_offset": 880, "unit": "dialogue:81bee04bd2790848", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN#0031", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN", "offset": 2199, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f271f0f9f8e1f484f8c8f0d7f29bf0cff1c781432f2ff27bfc8ff0b2f26af8e1f484f8c8fc95f94af154f8c8f1c8f1488144", "baseline_text": "모두의 힘을 합친다면，//계산 이상의 힘을 낼 수 있을 거야．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "みんなの力を合わせれば、//計算以上の力が出せるはずだ。", "pointer_offset": 884, "unit": "dialogue:9ed750a7ac27c224", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN#0032", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN", "offset": 2254, "capacity": 6, "raw_hex": "f0acf0b8f7d1", "baseline_text": "레니…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "レニ……", "pointer_offset": 888, "unit": "dialogue:4bc071b648458872", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN#0033", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN", "offset": 2263, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f2cef455f7d12f2ff0b1f0f48143f0e2f0e4f8e1f263f2d6f1442f2ff672f8f3fa99f16ff0af8144", "baseline_text": "후훗…//나도，대장의 말투가//옮은 것 같아．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "フフッ……//ボクも、隊長の口ぶりが//うつったみたいだ。", "pointer_offset": 892, "unit": "dialogue:3091a565274bc101", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN#0034", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN", "offset": 2490, "capacity": 34, "raw_hex": "f144f0fa8143f0e2f0e481442f2ff0abf143f8e7f0a4f167f94ff279f14bf1478144", "baseline_text": "가자，대장．//미래를 지키기 위해서．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "行こう、隊長。//未来を守るために。", "pointer_offset": 896, "unit": "dialogue:79f0bdc1be5ab400", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN#0035", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04013.SBN", "offset": 2353, "capacity": 14, "raw_hex": "f0aff0af8143f2c9f2e9f15a81b8", "baseline_text": "아아，알았어∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ああ、了解だ！", "pointer_offset": 900, "unit": "dialogue:c7a02f61e719122f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
